#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:2
msgid "References"
msgstr "参考"

#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:6
msgid "Terms"
msgstr "术语"

#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:8
msgid "Here we will explain some common used abbreviation and alias in aioqzone."
msgstr "这里解释 aioqzone 中常用的缩写和别名。"

#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:11
msgid "abstime"
msgstr "abstime"

#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:13
msgid ""
"A timestamp represents when the feed is created. All feeds have this field. If not, generate a "
"pseudo one is easy."
msgstr "表示 feed 创建时的时间戳。所有 feed 都有此字段。如果没有，生成一个伪时间戳也很容易。"

#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:16
msgid "In Qzone interface, this is called ``created_time`` sometimes."
msgstr "在 Qzone 接口中，有时称为 ``created_time``。"

#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:17
msgid "appid"
msgstr "appid"

#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:19
msgid ""
"Specifies where the feed is created. For example, the app id of \"emotion\" is 311, 202 means "
"shares from Wechat or other apps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:21
msgid "fid"
msgstr "fid"

#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:23
msgid ""
"Means \"feed id\". All \"emotion\" feed has a **unique** fid, but other app such as shares do "
"not. For those apps, their `fid` field might be a fixed string."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:26
msgid "In Qzone interface, `fid` is also named as ``tid``, ``feedkey``, etc."
msgstr "在 Qzone 接口中，`fid` 也称为 ``tid``、``feedkey`` 等。"

#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:27
msgid "uin"
msgstr "uin"

#: ../../source/aioqzone/reference.rst:29
msgid "Known as ``QQ``, which identifies an account."
msgstr "即 ``QQ`` 号，用于标识一个账户。"
